      FIELD /Ag__002__VB/instrument/electronanalyzer/name  shape=()  dtype=object
        Value     : Hemispherical Analyzer dummy
        Concept   : NXelectronanalyzer/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/ELECTRONANALYZER/name  [OPTIONAL]
        Inheritance:
